Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.68,0:00:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Nooooooooooooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.59,0:00:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm gonna keep these for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.76,0:00:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You meanie!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.67,0:00:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You jump scare me by showing up\Nand rip away something I love!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.21,0:00:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They're yours now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be hard for you, but it's\Nfor your own good, alright sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.06,0:00:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.98,0:00:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She's crying like a cat that's\Nbeen locked out in the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't give in this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.28,0:00:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll understand eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.22,0:00:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But maybe taking all of\Nthem at once was too harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.78,0:00:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I should just give her back one box.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha, the removal was a success!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon as I heard Emocha was coming over,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.74,0:00:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I put the ol' thinking cap\Non and got to swallow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Lighter, lighter, where's my...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.60,0:00:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you with the save.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.26,0:01:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the rotten shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.86,0:01:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,when you're all out,\Njust get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.84,0:01:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to push you out, and\NI'm trying to get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.34,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to get out of the way.\NI'm trying to get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for calling\Nout, God, to be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.94,0:02:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.30,0:02:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No money. I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.54,0:02:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,this is random!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.22,0:02:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've wanted to get something off my chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.08,0:02:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's easier if we're alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.68,0:02:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Well!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.10,0:02:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I guess you could tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.34,0:02:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had a big crush on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.28,0:02:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a really big crush, Imoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.08,0:03:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And if we get married one day, hey. Oh um.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.44,0:03:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,thank you for saying
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.92,0:03:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,that but i'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.10,0:03:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.92,0:03:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man, don't let this get to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.62,0:03:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If i had better hair she would have said\Nyes dude you're gonna bounce back there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.16,0:03:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,are so many girls out there man i don't\Nlike her she was it she was my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.36,0:03:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, whoa, whoa, whoa, dude
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.98,0:03:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,unbelievable Imoko this
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.46,0:03:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Imoko that shouldn't\Nseem that special to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.62,0:03:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fall. Don't fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.30,0:04:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.30,0:04:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you watch where you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.18,0:04:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.40,0:04:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, are you blind or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.98,0:04:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Mikoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.92,0:04:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really need to\Ntalk to her that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, but I was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Imoko, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.78,0:04:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.62,0:04:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.14,0:04:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.50,0:04:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about Mikoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell? Solve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.76,0:04:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.36,0:04:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I know that I'm\Nbeing an awful person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.82,0:04:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just not sure how\Nelse I'm supposed to act,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but I feel like my head's\Nprobably messed up all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.86,0:04:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here for you, and I know\Nyou'll get through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.94,0:04:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How about some Yonadas before we go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.06,0:04:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but you're buying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're buying, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.40,0:04:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, so why did you turn him down?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.14,0:05:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a pretty nice guy, and you've\Nsaid he's cute. He's hot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.24,0:05:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You could have at least given\Nhim a chance, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I Don't know how to say this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.38,0:05:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that I feel like he's too\Nwell put together. Does that make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinda
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.76,0:05:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.92,0:05:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to be right now,\Nlike three cigarettes! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.52,0:05:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.48,0:05:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You do realize that you would\Nnever last on your own, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.28,0:05:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.78,0:05:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.90,0:05:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I take care of my health\Ninsurance premium? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And one...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.94,0:05:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,number 12. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.74,0:05:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So what did you order a chiku a\Ncheeseburger and a nyamu shake? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.32,0:06:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Beastful coupon for the half off I have\Na chiku a cheeseburger and a nyamu shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So sorry about that if\NI was embarrassed I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.92,0:06:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure you were too. It's\Nfine. I've gotten used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.06,0:06:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,for being embarrassed by you, Yaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.86,0:06:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, thanks, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thing is, I was called\Nby a number for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Anytime I hear that\Nnumber, I can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.04,0:06:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I just react.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.42,0:06:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Four times three is 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.44,0:06:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then another 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.52,0:06:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Math class must have\Nreally sucked for you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.16,0:06:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.08,0:06:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Elementary school was actually okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.98,0:06:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened when I was\Na bit older. Oh, gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.48,0:06:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, a teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.10,0:06:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.96,0:06:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I forgot that Beast\NFolk can't become teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.98,0:06:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess part-timer it is, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.20,0:06:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be a lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.72,0:07:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You think Beast Folk can be lawyers?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.78,0:07:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.69,0:07:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Part-timer for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.34,0:07:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.66,0:07:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Muddy, here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.88,0:07:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctors are off-limits, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell's a Beast Folk supposed\Nto make a living in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.42,0:07:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This game sure is vintage, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.34,0:07:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all part-timers\Nwhether we like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.34,0:07:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The Beast Folk Life\Ngame is fun because it's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.60,0:07:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,completely different from the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, guess I'm a scholar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.92,0:07:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna bet we can't be that either?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.76,0:07:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.96,0:07:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, except I chose to be a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.92,0:07:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So now you've got a\Nproblem being a Beast Folk?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.09,0:07:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,does it really even matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.38,0:07:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A game that I'm kicking your asses at.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.96,0:07:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The smart move is to cough up the\Ncash and move to Machida right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.60,0:07:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're up to your neck and dip now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.50,0:07:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When you reach the goal,\Nyour debt goes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So the more in the hole\Nyou are, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.10,0:07:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that be nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, it's time to get married!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.56,0:07:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder what my partner's species is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.90,0:07:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a beesfolk marriage for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.18,0:08:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,After you're married, you find\Nout what species they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.66,0:08:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that seems silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.50,0:08:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm walking down the aisle with a\Nhuman, so it looks like, yay, money!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.58,0:08:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm marrying a human, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm marrying a beast folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.56,0:08:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, let's see what happens when\Na human marries a beast folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.54,0:08:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Yaku, read it. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.82,0:08:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're human in this game,\Nstay away from beast folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.86,0:08:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many differences\Ncompared to humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.68,0:08:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Many times,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,beast folk are physically superior to\Nhumans in speed, agility, and hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.16,0:08:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Beast folk excel in underwater mobility,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and when damp, their scent\Ncan be highly addictive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.52,0:08:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,As beast folk age, they retain a\Nvery youthful appearance, they meow,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.38,0:08:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,they can trigger cat allergies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.70,0:08:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And if either of the parents is a beast\Nfolk, the child will always be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's definitely an old game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.50,0:08:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Or a horror movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Next turn, that bullseye is mine! Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.04,0:08:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.82,0:09:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, friendly reminder, the main\Ngoal in this game is to die, not live?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a little creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.22,0:09:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The point is, you want to die happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So basically, one full\Nround is equal to one year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.72,0:09:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That means Yani died when\Nshe was 11 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.54,0:09:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna give that smoking a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.58,0:09:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I spent a 12, so I almost...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.36,0:09:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.18,0:09:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.09,0:09:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.66,0:09:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm to catch beetles again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.82,0:09:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Not weird at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.92,0:09:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're like a little kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm loving your butt-catching uniform!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.32,0:09:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.02,0:10:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,On my stream I'll tell a\Nstory about a 20-year-old
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.34,0:10:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,jobless beesfolk looking for\Nbeetles instead of a job!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.58,0:10:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll come with you and...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.30,0:10:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaku
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.00,0:10:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking for Beatles?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I don't got a minute to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.74,0:10:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.68,0:10:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't feel like going sorry, hon
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.86,0:10:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all alone
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Yaniko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.77,0:10:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she was starting a part-time job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.88,0:10:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'm pretty sure Tatsuro\Nhad some impossible work deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.26,0:10:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mariko has been drinking all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.76,0:10:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.74,0:10:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,it's not safe for a\Nyoung lady to go into the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,woods alone so be careful\Nout there you hear
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.04,0:10:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,okay she got fired from\Na part-time job didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.10,0:10:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,she I guess she's still\Nupset about it sorry I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.44,0:10:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,would have gone but there's a neighborhood
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.78,0:10:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Meeting today, you'll be\Nokay on your own. I'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.96,0:10:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,fine I have my cell\Nphone with me well you're
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,pretty tough kid Yahoo\Njust watch yourself okay
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaku, listen, if you really can't find\Nanything, then just let me know, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.52,0:11:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.50,0:11:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just a little\Nunexpected vacation is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.44,0:11:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for worrying about me, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.04,0:11:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.16,0:11:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.10,0:11:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, hey, Yani Neko.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.58,0:11:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Yaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.16,0:11:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought you had a part-time gig.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,More like part-time crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They said smoking was\Nallowed during the interview,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.48,0:11:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but when the smoking area is under\Nrenovation, suddenly smoking is a no-no?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.24,0:11:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, so I bounced.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.26,0:11:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You going to work right now or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.36,0:11:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.12,0:11:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to catch some beetles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.48,0:12:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm free, so how about I come with ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.06,0:12:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.18,0:12:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So, do beetles taste good or what? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't eat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.80,0:12:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean you're collecting\Nthem just for fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.10,0:12:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm looking for stag beetles,\Nand they're actually pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.02,0:12:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello to my Hame channel, subscribers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.12,0:12:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Today I have a fun surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.56,0:12:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, I'm here in the unexplored forest\Nwhere the Alpha is rumored to be living.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the Alpha?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.36,0:12:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.82,0:12:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the Beastfolk who\Nrule this whole region.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.80,0:12:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, do you remember that stuff\Nwe smoked that got you really high?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.28,0:12:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,These cigarettes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.84,0:12:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The Alphas actually grow\Nthe leaves for these.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.16,0:12:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Those were really smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.02,0:12:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.18,0:13:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of the ones I've run into are really\Nnice, so they'll give you some if you ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.22,0:13:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.58,0:13:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Special Zone No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,6, one of the Alpha Tobacco Villages.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.16,0:13:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.07,0:13:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like the Jomon period!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.06,0:13:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Yaku, you've returned to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And you brought a few companions, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.78,0:13:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.00,0:13:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the big shot who pretty much\Nruns everything around the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.12,0:13:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm Hone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.48,0:13:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm Yani.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.88,0:13:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I'm the chief here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.24,0:13:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Lonnie, our home welcomes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.10,0:13:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for just dropping by.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.16,0:13:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping my friends and I could\Npartake of some of your tobacco.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.66,0:13:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.57,0:13:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This year's harvest is upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.50,0:13:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The leaves are plentiful, so please,\Nsmoke as much as you would like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.72,0:13:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.30,0:13:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, while you're with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.84,0:13:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,perhaps you would like to learn about\Nour village as well as our customs?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.62,0:13:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Studying and me don't get\Nalong, but smoking and I do...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.48,0:13:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Count me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.39,0:14:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, we should be respectful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.50,0:14:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry, Yaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.56,0:14:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We start off by harvesting\Nthe grapes we grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.58,0:14:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We make wine out of the flesh,\Nand all of the leaves are dried.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.06,0:14:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You must drive them in the\Nshade for three to six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then remove the veins of the leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.50,0:14:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They're cut carefully into small pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.54,0:14:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And that is the process of the creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.88,0:14:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone in this village plays\Nan important part in making.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.18,0:14:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This tobacco.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.09,0:14:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who help grow it\Nmay smoke it as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.60,0:14:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Assisting us is key.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.24,0:14:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd like to partake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.46,0:14:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What a stupid rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.88,0:14:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you try to be nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.30,0:14:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your appreciation will certainly bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.00,0:14:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you help prepare the tobacco\Nwith your own two hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.88,0:14:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, now we work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.66,0:14:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks horrible. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.38,0:15:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Such is the way of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So good. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.90,0:15:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This stuff's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.60,0:15:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We have few complaints.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.18,0:15:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the crown jewel of the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.30,0:15:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The rich aroma does make those...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.94,0:15:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Electronic cigarettes\Nare way better than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.40,0:15:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, lady, maybe adding\Nsome menthol would be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.46,0:15:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be easier to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.60,0:15:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's wrong with you, Hame?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.42,0:15:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you speak to her\Nthat way, you're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.72,0:15:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.16,0:15:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not everyone has the\Nsame taste that we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.74,0:15:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It is simply not meant for her taste buds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.62,0:15:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're way more chill than I\Nfigured you would be. Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.52,0:15:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for all of this, chief. All is well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.44,0:15:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I take no offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.94,0:15:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Come look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.90,0:15:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That is Mianolith.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.60,0:16:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,For eons, our Alpha tribe has stood\Nwatch over the god enshrined inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.78,0:16:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was just a big wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.72,0:16:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,During the great conflict\Nof centuries past,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.86,0:16:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,we could hear the solemn meow of our god.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.22,0:16:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But now we exist in silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.74,0:16:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,When we prepare the tobacco,\Nwe offer a prayer to the God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.22,0:16:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We breathe prayer into\Neach chop of every leaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Chop means creator, hear our prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.16,0:16:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It reminds us to give thanks\Noften not only to our God,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.86,0:16:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but our ancestors for all of the\Npeace we have enjoyed on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.88,0:16:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, our tattoos mean the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.36,0:16:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,These two designs represent the Mianolith\Nconstantly reaching toward the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.66,0:16:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever our hearts lose their way,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.86,0:16:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,we look at these tattoos to\Nfind the right path once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.20,0:16:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pee-pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.72,0:16:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.60,0:16:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A pee-pee and a kuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.56,0:17:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.20,0:17:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Settle down, Wynn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.48,0:17:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Tryna light this bad boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.08,0:17:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This ritual is for the\Ncriminals within our
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.46,0:17:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,village who seek redemption\Nfrom the Mianolith.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.72,0:17:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Look from that edge. It is a small leap.\NI've witnessed even children complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.68,0:17:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This ritual you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.08,0:17:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,find the vines to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.30,0:17:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,be quite durable and worthy of your use
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.48,0:17:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The time for fear has passed jump well
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.36,0:18:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If I fall from here, I'll die. Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.58,0:18:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Afraid of dying there's a saying all in\Nour village know death should be kept
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.28,0:18:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Close it is your friend I won't be\Nable to smoke if I'm dead I'll give you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.52,0:18:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,a Generous share of our tobacco if you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.20,0:18:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,take the jump off
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.11,0:18:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,any
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.58,0:18:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,one of
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.38,0:18:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,you got a
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.06,0:18:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never met one like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.84,0:18:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Can she truly be without any fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.18,0:18:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe this isn't actually\Nas bad as I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.28,0:18:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.19,0:18:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,These crazy villagers\Njust told me that I'd
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.06,0:18:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,be killed if I didn't\Njump off this big tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.80,0:18:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.12,0:18:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too adorable to die! Seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.06,0:18:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a village of bullies!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.42,0:18:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Embrace fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.33,0:18:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.34,0:19:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I must say all of your\Njumps were quite impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.46,0:19:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,From this day forward, you\Nare part of our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.38,0:19:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You will always be welcome here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.20,0:19:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm sure you'll see me soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.70,0:19:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This stuff gets a 10.0.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.72,0:19:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like three days\Nworth all rolled into one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.94,0:19:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It was fun even with the hiccups.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.68,0:19:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We should go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.28,0:19:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a no for me. Huh? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.98,0:19:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Alpha totally loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.66,0:19:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You even got a nickname,\Nthe creator of rainbows.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.02,0:19:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That video view is, I mean, we have\Na ton of great footage. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.86,0:20:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what does\Nalpha mean anyway? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.96,0:20:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the first letter\Nof the Greek alphabet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.52,0:20:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, and what does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.92,0:20:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's something like\Nthe first one or the beginning?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.14,0:20:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.68,0:20:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get shot\Nwith a ray gun again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.50,0:20:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, we eatin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.14,0:20:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to get food before we go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.30,0:20:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I want Mabaroshiya's curry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.62,0:20:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You shit your pants and you still\Nwant to eat curry right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.70,0:20:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.84,0:20:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't shit my pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.24,0:20:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I call dips on the curry and beer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.24,0:20:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.66,0:20:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.57,0:20:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.42,0:20:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.33,0:20:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A cicada!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gaming for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.46,0:20:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you go, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.42,0:20:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a crazy reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.16,0:20:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.92,0:21:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to wash the chopsticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.38,0:21:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.84,0:21:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And why would you use chopsticks?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.08,0:21:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I seriously thought she was\Ngoing to eat that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.84,0:21:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm calling!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.00,0:21:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.91,0:21:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought some new ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You did?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.44,0:21:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got them from the cafeteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.32,0:21:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.98,0:21:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you mean you walked all\Nthe way over to the cafeteria?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.68,0:21:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you know, you wouldn't want to keep\Neating with your other chopsticks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.40,0:21:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.74,0:21:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, you're purring a lot right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.84,0:21:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You going through puberty?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.58,0:21:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.52,0:21:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.88,0:21:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.28,0:22:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck? That was gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.56,0:22:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to cook it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.04,0:22:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That was your problem with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.62,0:22:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It was good.
